          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Era mperaano, mbagemya Katonda n'ekibono eky'ekisa kye, ekisobola okubazimba n'okubafunisa omugabo aghalala n'abo boonaboona abatukuzibwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tyegombanga feeza oba zaabu oba kivaalo kya muntu yeenayeena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga mwena bwe mwidhi nakozesanga mikono gyange okufuna bye neetaaga n'eby'abo be nalinga nabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabooleka mu ebyo byonabyona bye nakola nti tuteekwa okufaabiikana okuyamba abanafu nga twidhukira ebibono bya Musengwa Yesu eyakoba ati, ‘Okugaba kwesiimisa okusinga okugheebwa.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
